      "side": 1,
      "message": "See the ESC [minutes] from April 1st, 2026, quoting:\n\n* **Gerrit v3.15** will be released on Java 25, but will retain source-level compatibility with Java 21.\n\nThat\u0027s why @matthias.sohn@gmail.com created stable-7.9 branch in JGit before merging JGit 25 java compilation level bump. See also corresponding [jgit-292] issue in JGit for announcement for this move.\n\nTo summarise: \n\n* JGit master (upcoming release 8.0) is only compatible with upcoming gerrit release 3.16.\n* JGit 7.9 is compatible with upcoming gerrit release 3.15.\n\n[minutes]: https://gerrit-review.googlesource.com/c/homepage/+/572741/10/_posts/2026-04-01-esc-minutes.md#82\n[jgit-292]: https://github.com/eclipse-jgit/jgit/issues/292",
